    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nVIEWINGS BY APPOINTMENT\n**4 Bedroom Houses starting at 530,000**\n\nSuperb A rated one, two, three and four bedroom homes, in a wonderful boutique development adjacent to Prosperous village and offering all the ingredients required for modern living with convenience to the city.Bower Court promises to be an exclusive development of just 10 homes that will boast efficient, modern layouts, attractive fittings and finishes combined with modern materials and energy efficient features ensuring they will be wonderful homes in a delightful village setting.Prosperous village is a wonderful setting with an array of excellent amenities and services including shops, schools (primary and secondary), church, cafes, restaurants, crèches, playground and a wide range of sporting an recreational facilities.Residents of Bower Court will be able to enjoy the convenience of all these local services whilst still being within an easy commute of Dublin city and its surrounding areas via a frequent bus service, rail links from Sallins and Maynooth combined with easy access to the M4 and M7 motorways. \n\nPlans and specifications available for inspection upon request.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE THAT SOME IMAGES HAVE BEEN VIRTUALLY STAGED**"
      },
